      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PROPOSITION JOE NZ (5) had no luck from the back row in the WA Derby last start but had been racing consistently against the good three-year-olds prior, placing behind subsequent Derby winner Im Stealthy in the G3 Western Gateway two back. He is well placed in this line-up. PATRIARCH NZ (11) continued a strong run of form when registering another success last start, scoring by more than 9 metres over this distance to take his strike rate here to 50 per cent. Draws on the back row so luck may play a role but he is going well. AMERICAN MACHINE (12) took advantage of the ace draw for a fine second in the WA Derby last start. Tougher draw this time but must be respected off that last performance. AMERICAN FALCON NZ (10) may need a few good breaks from an awkward draw but did well to overcome a wide barrier and win here last week.",
